<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="pre-raid-best-in-slot">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_hammer_17.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Pre-Raid Best in Slot for Enhancement Shamans</span></h2>This is an example of the Best in Slot gear available from all PvE sources available before entering a raid. While this gear may technically be the best available without raiding, it is unlikely that you will have or need all of these items before entering your first raid, and as you gain raid gear, your priorities will shift.<div class="clear exclude-units"></div>
