<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Enhancement Shamans</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria brings with it a whole lot of world content with the chance to get powerful gear. This includes World Bosses such as <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a> and <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=62346/galleon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Galleon</span></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>Sha of Anger is notable in that it drops item level 496 Tier 14 Legs and Gloves, as well as various item level 483 Malevolent Gladiator's pieces. This is a great way to get a headstart on your Tier set if you get lucky. <br/>
<br/>The first time you kill the Sha of Anger, it will also drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>. This can be turned in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90906/treads-of-ardent-antagonism">
<img alt="Treads of Ardent Antagonism" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_mail_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Treads of Ardent Antagonism</span></a>, a decent pair of early Boots.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="galleon">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mushanbeastmount.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Galleon</span></h3>Galleon drops a variety of powerful item level 496 gear, which will provide an even bigger boost to your character than even most celestial gear. Alongside a mount, the most interesting drops for Enhancement Shamans are <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90437/hereditary-saurok-loop">
<img alt="Hereditary Saurok Loop" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_145.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hereditary Saurok Loop</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90453/girdle-of-the-raging-rider">
<img alt="Girdle of the Raging Rider" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_mail_raidhunter_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Girdle of the Raging Rider</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90432/hellriders-choker">
<img alt="Hellrider's Choker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_100.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hellrider's Choker</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90421/chain-of-unsiezed-skies">
<img alt="Chain of Unsiezed Skies" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_mail_raidhunter_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Chain of Unsiezed Skies</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90444/treads-of-gentle-nudges">
<img alt="Treads of Gentle Nudges" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_mail_raidhunter_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Treads of Gentle Nudges</span></a>, and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90413/crest-of-the-grand-warband">
<img alt="Crest of the Grand Warband" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_mail_dungeonmail_c_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crest of the Grand Warband</span></a>.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Reputation Items for Enhancement Shamans</span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, but it can also be difficult to choose which factions to prioritize first. As an Enhancement Shaman, we recommend you prioritize <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1337/the-klaxxi">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The Klaxxi</span></a> to be able to purchase <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89058/klaxxi-lash-of-the-winnower">
<img alt="Klaxxi Lash of the Winnower" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_mail_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Klaxxi Lash of the Winnower</span></a>, a very potent early belt option. Reaching <span class="rep-exalted">Exalted</span> with the Klaxxi also gives access to a high item level ring <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90861/seal-of-the-windreaver">
<img alt="Seal of the Windreaver" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_epicring_b3.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seal of the Windreaver</span></a>, and offers a weapon option comparable to Heroic Dungeon Items with <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89400/amber-sledge-of-klaxxivess">
<img alt="Amber Sledge of Klaxxi'vess" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_1h_pandariatradeskill_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amber Sledge of Klaxxi'vess</span></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="the-klaxxi">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
